# Files that should not be uploaded to EAS Build / EAS Update.
#
# EAS falls back to .gitignore when this file is absent. It exists because
# `mockup/`, `docs/` and `prompts/` are deliberately tracked in git (they are
# the design reference and the handover material) but are not part of the app
# and must not be uploaded with every build.
#
# This has no effect on Metro, Gradle or local builds. Only EAS uploads.

# Design references and documentation
mockup/
docs/
prompts/

# Generated native projects (regenerated by prebuild)
/android
/ios

# Local tooling and caches
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
